  <p>
    Several campsites around Nijmegen get especially busy during Four Days Marches week.
    Expect full capacity well ahead of the event itself — camping is one of the first
    options to sell out.
  </p>

  <h2>What a camping spot costs</h2>
  <p>
    Prices during the Four Days Marches are typically higher than a regular summer week.
    Once we've partnered with specific providers, you'll find an up-to-date price
    indication here.
  </p>

  <h2>What to expect</h2>
  <p>
    Facilities and sanitary provisions are often more limited than on a regular campsite,
    given the temporary crowds. Booking early gives you more choice in location and
    amenities.
  </p>

